DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nChicago Comedy Club LIVE at Foundation Room at Hou
	se of Blues Chicago\nChicago Comedy Club brings its signature blend of sta
	nd-up comedy to the intimate and upscale Foundation Room at House of Blues
	 Chicago. This weekly comedy showcase features top local and touring comed
	ians in one of Chicago’s most unique venues. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursd
	ay\, July 23\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Foundation Roo
	m at House of Blues Chicago\nAddress: 329 N Dearborn St\, Chicago\, IL 606
	54\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: Standing Room Only 
	/ General Admission\nParking: Valet parking available at Marina City compl
	ex \nAbout Chicago Comedy Club\nChicago Comedy Club is a premier comedy sh
	owcase that brings together the best stand-up comedians performing in Chic
	ago. Known for its high-energy shows and top-tier talent\, the club has be
	come a staple of Chicago’s vibrant comedy scene. Every performance feature
	s a rotating lineup of hilarious performers guaranteed to keep you laughin
	g all night. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from top perf
	ormers\nIntimate VIP-style setting in the Foundation Room\nFull bar servic
	e with a 2-item minimum purchase\nDoors open at 6PM\, show begins at 7:30P
	M\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nStanding room only venue with grea
	t sightlines\n\nVenue Information\nThe Foundation Room at House of Blues C
	hicago is an exclusive\, members-style lounge located at 329 N Dearborn St
	 in the heart of Chicago. This intimate venue offers a luxurious atmospher
	e with full bar service\, making it the perfect setting for an unforgettab
	le comedy night. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through T
	icketmaster. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. Resale tickets may also
	 be available through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThi
	s post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tick
	ets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show 
	times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttp
	s://comedycalendar.com/event/chicago-comedy-club-live-at-foundation-room-a
	t-house-of-blues-chicago/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chicago-comedy-club-live-at-foundation
	-room-at-house-of-blues-chicago/
