SUMMARY:Tony Rock LIVE at Arlington Improv
DTSTAMP:20260722T053839Z
DTSTART:20260723T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nTony Rock is a comedian\, actor\, and producer widely regarded as one
	 of the hardest working men in show business. Born in Brooklyn\, NY\, he i
	s the younger brother of Chris Rock and has carved out his own legendary c
	areer in stand-up comedy and television. \nHe hosted HBO’s All Def Comedy\
	, NBA TV’s The Warm Up\, BET’s Black Card Revoked\, and Apollo Live\, and 
	co-starred in CBS’ primetime series Living Biblically. Off stage\, Tony is
	 the founder of the MyROCK Diabetes Foundation\, a charity established in 
	honor of his late father. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026
	 \nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM) \nVenue: Arlington Improv\, 309 Curt
	is Mathes Way #147\, Arlington\, TX 76018 \nAge Restriction: 18+ \nPrice R
	ange: $25 to $70 per person \nAbout the Venue\nArlington Improv is located
	 in the Highlands Shopping Center in Arlington\, TX\, across from Torchy’s
	 Tacos. It is an intimate comedy club featuring a full bar and restaurant 
	where guests enjoy world-renowned and local comics in a lively\, up-close 
	setting. \nThe venue also hosts Black Dog Pizza Arcade\, a full-scale free
	-play retro arcade featuring more than 30 local craft beers. Seating is as
	signed based on date of purchase. A 2-item food or beverage minimum per pe
	rson applies once seated\, and there is an 18% service charge on all check
	s in the showroom. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Rock delivers a full headlining 
	stand-up set packed with his signature sharp wit\, personal stories\, and 
	the kind of commanding stage presence that comes from decades of performin
	g at the highest level. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-filled evening from s
	tart to finish. \nThis is an 18+ event. Doors open at 6:00 PM. Food and be
	verage service ends approximately 45 minutes into the show. All sales are 
	final\, no refunds or exchanges. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from 
	$25 to $70 per person. Purchase official tickets or find resale options be
	low. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
	tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv/
LOCATION:Arlington Improv\, 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147\, Arlington\, TX\, 7
	6018\, United States Of America
