	e hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar service
	 with a two-drink minimum per person\nA fun Thursday night out in San Fran
	cisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club 
	is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located at 915 Colu
	mbus Avenue in the heart of North Beach. The club has hosted legendary com
	edians for decades and offers an intimate\, welcoming atmosphere perfect f
	or an evening of live comedy. Street parking is available nearby\, and the
