	e comedy legend\nHilarious storytelling and crowd interaction\nAn intimate
	 comedy club experience at Addison Improv\nNon-stop laughs from start to f
	inish\nFull bar and food service available\n\nVenue Information\nAddison I
	mprov is located at 4980 Belt Line Road #250 in Addison (Dallas)\, TX\, on
	 the second floor at the southwest corner of Belt Line Road and Quorum Dri
	ve. This premier comedy club offers an intimate setting with full food and
	 bar service. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $50 and
